    {
      "id": "r20261021-a01",
      "title": "A Visit to the Museum",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Last Saturday, Rani and her family visited the national museum. They left home early because the museum is far from their house. They went there by bus.",
        "At the museum, Rani saw old statues, traditional clothes, and beautiful paintings. Her favorite room had dinosaur bones. She took many photos with her phone.",
        "Before they went home, Rani bought a small book about the museum. She wants to read it tonight. She hopes to visit the museum again next year."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "museum": "museum",
        "statues": "patung",
