    {
      "id": "r20261021-a02",
      "title": "Why Cities Need More Trees",
      "level": "Menengah atas",
      "min": 4,
      "body": [
        "Many big cities are planting more trees, and there are good reasons for this. Trees do much more than make streets look beautiful. They actually improve life for everyone who lives nearby.",
        "First, trees clean the air. Their leaves take in harmful gases and produce oxygen. Second, trees keep cities cooler. On hot days, the temperature under a big tree can be several degrees lower than in the sun. Finally, trees give people a place to relax. Studies show that spending time near trees can reduce stress.",
        "However, planting trees is only the beginning. Young trees need water and care for many years. Without this care, they will die before they can help anyone. Cities that invest in looking after their trees will see the greatest benefits."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "harmful": "berbahaya",
        "oxygen": "oksigen",
        "several": "beberapa",
        "reduce": "mengurangi",
        "invest": "berinvestasi",
        "benefits": "manfaat"
      },
